  "notes": [
    "Anchored on the initialize() call that installed the attacker's implementation (rule 10); the campaign is every later drain through it. Three further calls moved nothing and are omitted.",
    "The reset is the registry entry for Aave's LendingPool proxy, added after the Furucombo proxy's deployment; batchExec only delegatecalls registry-valid addresses, so the exploit needed it (rule 8 registry grant).",
    "aTokens are valued 1:1 with their underlying and cTokens at exchangeRateStored, at DefiLlama prices; PAID and GRO have no price and are valued at the attacker's 1inch proceeds (132.84 and 5.74 ETH)."
  ]
